1
00:00:00,712 --> 00:00:03,252
(Leonard:)You cannot blow up my head
with your mind.

2
00:00:03,423 --> 00:00:05,383
Then I'll settle for an aneurism.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,300
(Penny:)- Stop it.
- You hit me.

4
00:00:07,469 --> 00:00:08,719
You saw that. He hit me.

5
00:00:08,887 --> 00:00:11,227
- You tried to blow up my head.
- So it was working.

6
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,470
(Leonard:)It wasn't... It was not...
You are a nutcase.

7
00:00:13,642 --> 00:00:16,982
We'll see. Heads up, you people
in the front row. This is a splash zone.

8
00:00:17,145 --> 00:00:18,895
Stop it. Stop it.

9
00:00:19,231 --> 00:00:20,901
(Leonard:)Quit it.

10
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:24,359
[BOTH GRUNTING]

11
00:00:25,946 --> 00:00:28,576
(Penny:)Is this usually
how these physics things go?

12
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,080
(Howard:)More often than you'd think.

13
00:00:33,578 --> 00:00:35,248
Hit you with a Vulcan nerve pinch.

14
00:00:35,414 --> 00:00:36,874
- No pinches. No...!
- No!

15
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,460
[LOCK CLICKING]

16
00:00:46,591 --> 00:00:49,301
(Sheldon:)You could have offered me a ride home.

17
00:00:50,262 --> 00:00:52,762
(Leonard:)You're lucky I didn't run you over.

18
00:00:53,098 --> 00:00:55,178
(Sheldon:)I don't understand
what you're unhappy about.

19
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,850
(Sheldon:)You begged me to come, I came.
There's just no pleasing you.

20
00:00:59,021 --> 00:01:01,651
(Leonard:)You're right. I'm the problem,
the one that needs help.

